  "extraction_notes": "DATB 8a catalyst structure not drawn in this figure; only labeled by name. For compound 21, the cage structure is interpreted as adamantane. For compound 28, the heterocycle is interpreted as benzo[b]thiophene based on the fused ring drawing, though it could be a simple thiophene. Amine 11a is interpreted as 4-fluoroaniline based on consistency between compounds 21 and 25. The exact regiochemistry of compound 26 (indole-5-carboxamide vs other position) is inferred from drawing but could be different."
